<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Abacus Direct raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Abacus Direct raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Hambrecht &amp; Quist said Thursday it had raised its rating for Abacus Direct Corp to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Westminster, Colo., information services company were up 1-1/2 to 22-1/2.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
